              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Special Character. Armed with a hand weapon, bow, thrusting spear and lamellar armour. May ride a horse (free; Movement 8"). Army General. Warrior of Legend. Fearsome. Steppe Nomad Cavalry. Founder of the Xiongnu empire. (The Art of War p.71)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
