              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with a hand weapon, light armour, thrusting spear and bow. May have throwing spear instead of thrusting spear, lamellar armour (+2 pts, replaces light armour) and shield (+2 pts). Light Cavalry. Steppe Nomad Cavalry. Fearsome. 0-2. (The Art of War p.71)</characteristic>
