              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with a hand weapon and bow. May exchange bow for javelin and buckler at no extra points. May upgrade buckler to shield (+1 pt). May have throwing spears instead of javelins at no extra points. Light Infantry. 0-1. (The Art of War p.71)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
