              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with a hand weapon and bow. May have throwing spear (+2 pts) and shield (+2 pts). Light Cavalry. Steppe Nomad Cavalry. Fearsome. Must be the smallest unit of cavalry in the army (not enforced). Eagleshooters: sharpshooters who ignore the -1 modifier for shooting at long range. 0-1. (The Art of War p.71)</characteristic>
