  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="0ce4-f9bb-7d7c-d0c4" name="Eastern Steppe Nomads: Xiongnu (Art of War) - List Notes" publicationId="b792-78e1-7b03-d4d6" hidden="false">
      <description>XIONGNU (The Art of War, pp.70-71). Special rule: Fearsome (see the Art of War rules). Allies documented only: Qiang (Early Chinese Tribes list) and Wuhuan (Eastern Steppe Nomads list). The Shanyu's light armour option is printed as "light armour (+2 pts)" in addition to "lamellar armour instead of light armour (+2 pts)"; read as the lamellar upgrade only. Percentage limits are by points. "May only have one selected option per 1,000 points" for Special Units is documented only.

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[Xiongnu]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Cavalry: up to 100%
  Infantry: up to 25%
  Special Units: up to 25%
  XIONGNU. Characters up to 25%. Cavalry: any amount. Infantry up to 25%. Special Units up to 25% (one selected option per 1,000 points). May have up to 25% Allies instead of selected options: Qiang Allies from the Early Chinese Tribes list, Wuhuan Allies from the Eastern Steppe Nomads list (documented only).</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
